-- title:
--   Multi Period: is Compact feas Graph fiber
-- statement:
--   Fibers of the feasibility graph at probability kernels are compact in
--       the weak topology (couplings of fixed marginals are compact).
--
--   Source: https://github.com/MaxWellApexLab/BicausalOT-palomar/blob/3fe500ff64a75d7ab71b474d0c656d5471f62992/BicausalOT/LscBellman.lean#L75-L81
-- source:
